{
 "id": "256-29",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "Well, my first piece of advice might sound a little unusual, but I want you to forget about using a whiteboard for brainstorming.",
  "It's a common tool, I know, but I've found that it can actually hinder the creative process for some people.",
  "Instead, I want you to try using a different medium for your brainstorming sessions.",
  "Give yourself the freedom to explore ideas without the pressure of a whiteboard.",
  "You can always transfer your ideas to a digital format later if needed.",
  "Remember, it's all about finding the methods that work best for you.",
  "Don't be afraid to experiment and find your own path.",
  "That's what SYNERGY is all about \u2013 embracing unique perspectives and innovative thinking.",
  "So, as you know, we use a variety of tools to manage our projects and stay organized.",
  "So, going forward, I want us to utilize the whiteboard for all our brainstorming sessions.",
  "It will help us organize our thoughts, create a visual reference, and make it easier to track our progress.",
  "From now on, I'd like you to follow a specific naming convention for function and argument names.",
  "For function names, please start them with 'fn_'.",
  "And for argument names, end them with '_i'.",
  "This will help us maintain consistency and improve the readability of our code.",
  "It's primarily for consistency and readability.",
  "By enforcing these conventions, we ensure that our code is uniform and easily understandable for all team members.",
  "It also helps when collaborating with others, as it provides a clear and familiar structure to our functions and arguments."
 ],
 "admitted": 18,
 "relations_applied": 0,
